# Packages-Desktop — GUI packages
# Installed after Base. The gamescope session is a tiling Wayland compositor
# purpose-built for gaming, not a full desktop environment — no GNOME/Plasma
# deps, just the gamescope session + the gaming stack.
#
# gamescope / mangohud come from Arch [extra]. gamescope-session-plus is a
# ShaniOS PKGBUILD (shani-pkgbuilds/gamescope-session-plus/, a portable
# reimplementation of ChimeraOS's MIT gamescope-session-plus framework).
# steam stays a flatpak, already in
# image_profiles/gamescope/flatpak-packages.txt.
shani-desktop-gamescope
# pipewire-audio provides ladspa-host; naming it here settles the
# virtual provider so a package that needs one (e.g. swh-plugins)
# in the future) never pulls a DAW like ardour. Already in the
# image via shani-multimedia - this line is the provider choice.
pipewire-audio
shani-fonts
desktop-entry-hider
shani-backup
